sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title UC2-A Officer reviews and requests changes
    actor Ofc as Officer
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI (api → services)
    participant WF as domain.workflow
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Op as Operator

    Ofc->>UI: open review queue
    UI->>API: GET /officer/applications
    API->>API: require_role(officer)
    API->>DB: list applications (internal status, counts)
    API-->>UI: queue with officer labels

    Ofc->>UI: open application, Start review
    UI->>API: POST /officer/applications/{id}/transition {target: under_review, expected_version}
    API->>WF: transition(application_received → under_review, officer)
    API->>DB: status, version+1, audit status.changed, notification to operator ("Under Review")
    API-->>UI: 200 officer view (sections, documents, AI results, feedback)

    Ofc->>UI: add feedback (target: section premises, template "missing floor area")
    UI->>API: POST /officer/applications/{id}/feedback
    API->>DB: insert Feedback(open, raised_in_revision), audit feedback.created
    API-->>UI: 201 feedback

    Ofc->>UI: Request resubmission
    UI->>API: POST /officer/applications/{id}/transition {target: pending_pre_site_resubmission, note}
    API->>DB: count open feedback
    API->>WF: transition(under_review → pending_pre_site_resubmission, officer, ctx{open_feedback ≥ 1})
    alt guard fails (0 open)
        API-->>UI: 422 feedback_required
    else
        API->>DB: status, version+1, audit status.changed, notification to operator ("Pending Pre-Site Resubmission")
        API-->>UI: 200
        Op-->>Op: sees notification and feedback on top of application
    end
